cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Polymarket T_news / T_event Recovery Dataset"
abstract: >-
  A curated dataset of public-event and news-arrival timestamps for 2,052
  resolved Polymarket markets, recovered across three methodological tiers:
  UMA Oracle proposer evidence (Tier 1, gold standard), GDELT-based proxy
  matching (Tier 2, structural), and LLM-assisted multi-source verification
  (Tier 3, high-stakes cases). Released as a community resource for
  event-study and information-leakage research on decentralized prediction
  markets.
type: dataset
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-05-13"
license: CC-BY-4.0
